OL,3,GNEWSAPublish council changes legal
OL,4,Aadvice, MPs say
OL,5,
OL,6,FMPs and councillors in Surrey say there
OL,7,Fare questions to answer after ministers
OL,8,Fput a major shake-up of local councils
OL,9,Fon hold.
OL,11,FThe government said it had paused
OL,12,Frestructuring plans for more than a
OL,13,Fdozen authorities following fresh legal
OL,14,Fadvice.
OL,16,FLocal Government Secretary Angela
OL,17,FRayner told MPs that the reorganisation
OL,18,Fin Surrey, where councillors for two
OL,19,Fnew unitary authorities were elected in
OL,20,FMay, will not be affected by the
OL,21,Freview.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
