OL,3,GNEWSAPublish council changes legal
OL,4,Aadvice, MPs say
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat and Conservative
OL,7,Fpoliticians have called for the legal
OL,8,Fadvice to be published and also for
OL,9,Fmore detail to be provided to discover
OL,10,Fwhether there is any potential impact
OL,11,Ffor the new East and West Surrey
OL,12,Fcouncils.
